# ==============================================================================
# Good Grade Academy — Supabase Backend Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# 
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. In your Supabase project dashboard, navigate to: Project Settings -> API
# 3. Copy your "Project URL" into VITE_SUPABASE_URL below
# 4. Copy your "anon public" API key into VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY below
#    (SECURITY WARNING: NEVER expose or paste your secret service_role key here!)
# 5. In Supabase SQL Editor, execute the schema from: supabase/schema.sql
# 6. Create your admin user in Authentication -> Users, and run the SQL promotion script from schema.sql
# 7. Copy or rename this file to .env in your project root
# 
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-public-key
